        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-28T21:36:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We are not actually planning to have a \"pre order\" period for Sentinel Tactics. Once the game is shipped to Kickstarter backers and available in sufficient quantities to support web store sales, we'll immediately make it available. The amount of time between Kickstarter shipping, and web store availability, and retailer availability, however, will likely be longer than on previous products because the Sentinel Tactics print run will be arriving in waves rather than all at once.</p>",
